{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063908/block/singleImage/3267862/df/1587067686_jh.jpg?updatedAt=1794747201\"/><figcaption>新患者完成家居檢疫後，自行到明愛醫院求診。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>深水埗發生墮物傷人案。今日(15日)下午4時許，一名65歲女子與母親途經鴨寮街與白楊街交界時，突然被高處墮下的硬物擊中頭部，受傷浴血。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，為傷者包紮，隨後送往明愛醫院治理，她當時清醒。警方在現場檢走一塊面積約為3厘米乘5厘米的金屬碎片，並調查金屬碎片的來源。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.929002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:53:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:17.362421+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:17.362421+00:00","content_hash":"946d48d158ed2a91aeb62b251835e5a7b1edad7d266f5642e8f0ac8d3db835e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}